sha1collisiondetection: SHA-1 with collision detection (sha1dc)

These four files are the library of Marc Stevens and Dan Shumow, with no
change. Git uses the same library for the names of its objects. The helper
program git_sha1dc of beam.com (c_src/cosmo/beam_com_sha1dc.c) includes
them, for the git client (src/beam_com/beam_com_git.erl).

Source: https://github.com/cr-marcstevens/sha1collisiondetection
Tag:    stable-v1.0.3 (commit 38096fc021ac5b8f8207c7e926f11feb6b5eb17c)
Files:  lib/sha1.c, lib/sha1.h, lib/ubc_check.c, lib/ubc_check.h
License: MIT License (licenses/sha1collisiondetection.txt, the file
         LICENSE.txt of the tag)

The SHA-256 of each file:

